  "name": "Health and Social Care Committee",
  "parent_committee_id": null,
  "purpose": "<p>Welcome to the cross-party Health and Social Care Committee. It is our responsibility to scrutinise the work of the Department of Health and Social Care and its associated public bodies. We examine government policy, spending and administration on behalf of the electorate and the House of Commons.&nbsp;<a href=\"https://committees.parliament.uk/committee/81/health-and-social-care-committee/content/111518/get-involved/\">Get involved</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Follow us on social media:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/hoccommittees.parliament.uk\">Bluesky</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ukcommonscommittees\">Instagram</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61579513151155\">Facebook</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/house-of-commons-committees/\">LinkedIn</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/user/UKCommonsCommittees/\">Reddit</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/HoCcommitteesUK\">X</a>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLj3mInRJqIekxA--aDW780T_TUCwjea4M\">YouTube</a>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://mailchi.mp/email/committeecorridor\">Subscribe to the Committee Corridor newsletter</a> for a weekly round-up of news, inquiry updates and reports from House of Commons committees.</p>",
